{"s":80,"v":[{"t":"He [i.e., the Prophet (ﷺ) ] frowned and turned away","w":[["عَبَسَ","He frowned","ʿabasa",""],["وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ","and turned away","watawallā","",[["وَ",1],["تَوَلَّىٰٓ",159]]]]},{"t":"Because there came to him the blind man, [interrupting].","w":[["أَن","Because","an",""],["جَآءَهُ","came to him","jāahu","",[["جَآءَ",57],["هُ",5]]],["ٱلْأَعْمَىٰ","the blind man","l-aʿmā","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَعْمَىٰ",483]]]]},{"t":"But what would make you perceive, [O Muḥammad], that perhaps he might be purified","w":[["وَمَا","But what","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["يُدْرِيكَ","would make you know","yud'rīka","",[["يُدْرِي",558],["كَ",18]]],["لَعَلَّهُۥ","that he might","laʿallahu","",[["لَعَلَّ",109],["هُۥ",5]]],["يَزَّكَّىٰٓ","purify himself","yazzakkā",""]]},{"t":"Or be reminded and the remembrance would benefit him?","w":[["أَوْ","Or","aw",""],["يَذَّكَّرُ","be reminded","yadhakkaru",""],["فَتَنفَعَهُ","so would benefit him","fatanfaʿahu","",[["فَ",7],["تَنفَعَ",373],["هُ",5]]],["ٱلذِّكْرَىٰٓ","the reminder","l-dhik'rā","",[["ٱل",2],["ذِّكْرَىٰٓ",132]]]]},{"t":"As for he who thinks himself without need,","w":[["أَمَّا","As for","ammā",""],["مَنِ","(him) who","mani",""],["ٱسْتَغْنَىٰ","considers himself free from need","is'taghnā",""]]},{"t":"To him you give attention.","w":[["فَأَنتَ","So you","fa-anta","",[["فَ",7],["أَنتَ",18]]],["لَهُۥ","to him","lahu","",[["لَ",8],["هُۥ",5]]],["تَصَدَّىٰ","give attention","taṣaddā",""]]},{"t":"And not upon you [is any blame] if he will not be purified.","w":[["وَمَا","And not","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["عَلَيْكَ","upon you","ʿalayka","",[["عَلَيْ",19],["كَ",18]]],["أَلَّا","that not","allā","",[["أَ",29],["لَّا",13]]],["يَزَّكَّىٰ","he purifies himself","yazzakkā",""]]},{"t":"But as for he who came to you striving [for knowledge]","w":[["وَأَمَّا","But as for","wa-ammā","",[["وَ",1],["أَمَّا",224]]],["مَن","(he) who","man",""],["جَآءَكَ","came to you","jāaka","",[["جَآءَ",57],["كَ",18]]],["يَسْعَىٰ","striving","yasʿā",""]]},{"t":"While he fears [Allāh],","w":[["وَهُوَ","While he","wahuwa","",[["وَ",1],["هُوَ",5]]],["يَخْشَىٰ","fears","yakhshā",""]]},{"t":"From him you are distracted.","w":[["فَأَنتَ","But you","fa-anta","",[["فَ",7],["أَنتَ",18]]],["عَنْهُ","from him","ʿanhu","",[["عَنْ",34],["هُ",5]]],["تَلَهَّىٰ","(are) distracted","talahhā",""]]},{"t":"No! Indeed, they [i.e., these verses] are a reminder;","w":[["كَلَّآ","Nay","kallā",""],["إِنَّهَا","Indeed, it","innahā","",[["إِنَّ",15],["هَا",22]]],["تَذْكِرَةٌۭ","(is) a reminder","tadhkiratun",""]]},{"t":"So whoever wills may remember it.","w":[["فَمَن","So whosoever","faman","",[["فَ",7],["مَن",25]]],["شَآءَ","wills","shāa",""],["ذَكَرَهُۥ","may remember it","dhakarahu","",[["ذَكَرَ",148],["هُۥ",5]]]]},{"t":"[It is recorded] in honored sheets,","w":[["فِى","In","fī",""],["صُحُفٍۢ","sheets","ṣuḥufin",""],["مُّكَرَّمَةٍۢ","honored","mukarramatin",""]]},{"t":"Exalted and purified,","w":[["مَّرْفُوعَةٍۢ","Exalted","marfūʿatin",""],["مُّطَهَّرَةٍۭ","purified","muṭahharatin",""]]},{"t":"[Carried] by the hands of messenger-angels,","w":[["بِأَيْدِى","In (the) hands","bi-aydī","",[["بِ",10],["أَيْدِى",116]]],["سَفَرَةٍۢ","(of) scribes","safaratin",""]]},{"t":"Noble and dutiful.","w":[["كِرَامٍۭ","Noble","kirāmin",""],["بَرَرَةٍۢ","dutiful","bararatin",""]]},{"t":"Destroyed [i.e., cursed] is man; how disbelieving is he.","w":[["قُتِلَ","Is destroyed","qutila",""],["ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","[the] man","l-insānu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["إِنسَـٰنُ",181]]],["مَآ","how","mā",""],["أَكْفَرَهُۥ","ungrateful is he","akfarahu","",[["أَكْفَرَ",2921],["هُۥ",5]]]]},{"t":"From what thing [i.e., substance] did He create him?","w":[["مِنْ","From","min",""],["أَىِّ","what","ayyi",""],["شَىْءٍ","thing","shayin",""],["خَلَقَهُۥ","He created him","khalaqahu","",[["خَلَقَ",76],["هُۥ",5]]]]},{"t":"From a sperm-drop He created him and destined for him;","w":[["مِن","From","min",""],["نُّطْفَةٍ","a semen-drop","nuṭ'fatin",""],["خَلَقَهُۥ","He created him","kha